#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1.text1"
msgstr "Ninu ifisilẹ yii <a %(annas_archive_note_2940)s> a nifẹ gaan awọn iru wiwo oriṣiriṣi, ni pataki awọn wiwo afiwe ati awọn wiwo olupilẹṣẹ."

