#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary"
msgstr "<strong>Àpamọ́ data binary.</strong> Àpamọ́ pẹ̀lú data binary ti àkójọpọ̀ AACs, fún àkójọpọ̀ kan pàtàkì. Wọ́n ní àwọn ànfàní wọ̀nyí:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.name"
msgstr "Orúkọ àkójọpọ̀ gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ àkójọpọ̀ AACID, tí a ti ṣàkàtúnṣe pẹ̀lú <code style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</code>, àti kò sí àfikún. Àpẹẹrẹ, ọ̀kan nínú àwọn ìtújáde wa gangan ní àkójọpọ̀ tí a ń pè ní<br><code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_files__20230808T055130Z--20230808T055131Z</span></code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.contents"
msgstr "Iwe itọnisọna gbọdọ ni awọn faili data fun gbogbo awọn AACs laarin ibiti a ti ṣalaye. Kọọkan faili data gbọdọ ni AACID rẹ gẹgẹ bi orukọ faili (ko si awọn itẹsiwaju)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.tip"
msgstr "A ṣe iṣeduro lati jẹ ki awọn folda wọnyi jẹ iwọn ti o le ṣakoso ni diẹ, e.g. ko tobi ju 100GB-1TB lọ kọọkan, botilẹjẹpe iṣeduro yii le yipada ni akoko pupọ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.torrents"
msgstr "<strong>Torrents.</strong> Awọn faili metadata ati awọn folda data binary le wa ni akopọ ninu awọn torrents, pẹlu torrent kan fun faili metadata kọọkan, tabi torrent kan fun folda data binary kọọkan. Awọn torrents gbọdọ ni orukọ faili/folda atilẹba pẹlu afikun <code>.torrent</code> gẹgẹ bi orukọ faili wọn."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.heading"
msgstr "Apeere"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text1"
msgstr "Jẹ ki a wo itusilẹ Z-Library wa laipe gẹgẹ bi apeere. O ni awọn akojọpọ meji: “<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>” ati “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”. Eyi n gba wa laaye lati yọ ati tu awọn igbasilẹ metadata lọtọ kuro ninu awọn faili iwe gangan. Nitorinaa, a tu awọn torrents meji pẹlu awọn faili metadata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text2"
msgstr "A tun tu ọpọlọpọ awọn torrents pẹlu awọn folda data binary, ṣugbọn fun akojọpọ “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>” nikan, 62 lapapọ:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text3"
msgstr "Nipa ṣiṣe <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z.jsonl.zst</span></code> a le wo ohun ti o wa ninu:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text4"
msgstr "Ni idi eyi, o jẹ metadata ti iwe gẹgẹ bi a ti royin nipasẹ Z-Library. Ni ipele oke a ni “aacid” ati “metadata” nikan, ṣugbọn ko si “data_folder”, nitori ko si data binary ti o baamu. AACID ni “22430000” gẹgẹ bi ID akọkọ, eyiti a le rii pe o gba lati “zlibrary_id”. A le nireti awọn AAC miiran ninu akojọpọ yii lati ni eto kanna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "Bayi jẹ ki a ṣe <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "Eyi jẹ metadata AAC ti o kere pupọ, botilẹjẹpe pupọ julọ ti AAC yii wa ni ibomiiran ninu faili binary! Lẹhin gbogbo ẹ, a ni “data_folder” ni akoko yii, nitorinaa a le nireti data binary ti o baamu lati wa ni <code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code>. “Metadata” ni “zlibrary_id”, nitorinaa a le ni irọrun so mọ AAC ti o baamu ninu akojọpọ “zlib_records”. A le ti so ni ọpọlọpọ awọn ọna oriṣiriṣi, e.g. nipasẹ AACID — boṣewa ko ṣalaye iyẹn."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Ṣe akiyesi pe ko ṣe pataki fun aaye “metadata” lati jẹ JSON funrararẹ. O le jẹ okun ti o ni XML tabi eyikeyi ọna kika data miiran. O le paapaa tọju alaye metadata ninu blob binary ti o ni nkan ṣe, e.g. ti o ba jẹ pupọ ti data."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.heading"
msgstr "Ipari"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Pẹlu boṣewa yii, a le ṣe awọn itusilẹ diẹdiẹ diẹ sii, ati ni irọrun diẹ sii ṣafikun awọn orisun data tuntun. A ti ni diẹ ninu awọn itusilẹ igbadun diẹ ninu opo gigun!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text2"
msgstr "A tun nireti pe o di irọrun fun awọn ile-ikawe ojiji miiran lati ṣe afiwe awọn akojọpọ wa. Lẹhin gbogbo ẹ, ibi-afẹde wa ni lati ṣetọju imọ eniyan ati aṣa lailai, nitorinaa diẹ sii ni atunṣe ti o dara julọ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion"
msgstr "- Anna ati ẹgbẹ (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.title"
msgstr "Imudojuiwọn Anna: ile-ikawe orisun ṣiṣi patapata, ElasticSearch, 300GB+ ti awọn ideri iwe"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.tldr"
msgstr "A ti n ṣiṣẹ ni gbogbo aago lati pese yiyan ti o dara pẹlu Ile-ikawe Anna. Eyi ni diẹ ninu awọn nkan ti a ti ṣaṣeyọri laipẹ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.text1"
msgstr "Pẹlu Z-Library ti n lọ silẹ ati awọn oludasilẹ rẹ (ti a fi ẹsun kan) ti n gba, a ti n ṣiṣẹ ni gbogbo aago lati pese yiyan ti o dara pẹlu Ile-ikawe Anna (a kii yoo so mọ ibi, ṣugbọn o le Google rẹ). Eyi ni diẹ ninu awọn nkan ti a ti ṣaṣeyọri laipẹ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source"
msgstr "Ile-ikawe Anna jẹ orisun ṣiṣi patapata"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text1"
msgstr "A gbagbọ pe alaye yẹ ki o jẹ ọfẹ, ati koodu tiwa ko ṣe iyasọtọ. A ti tu gbogbo koodu wa silẹ lori Gitlab ti ara wa: <a %(annas_archive)s>Sọfitiwia Anna</a>. A tun lo atẹle ọrọ lati ṣeto iṣẹ wa. Ti o ba fẹ kopa ninu idagbasoke wa, eyi jẹ aaye nla lati bẹrẹ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text2"
msgstr "Lati fun ọ ni itọwo awọn ohun ti a n ṣiṣẹ lori, gba iṣẹ wa laipẹ lori awọn ilọsiwaju iṣẹ-ṣiṣe ẹgbẹ alabara. Niwọn igba ti a ko ti ṣe imuse ipinpinpin sibẹsibẹ, a yoo maa pada awọn oju-iwe wiwa gigun pupọ, pẹlu awọn abajade 100-200. A ko fẹ ge awọn abajade wiwa kuro ni kutukutu, ṣugbọn eyi tumọ si pe yoo fa fifalẹ diẹ ninu awọn ẹrọ. Fun eyi, a ṣe imuse ẹtan kekere kan: a fi ọpọlọpọ awọn abajade wiwa sinu awọn asọye HTML (<code><!-- --></code>), lẹhinna kọ Javascript kekere kan ti yoo ṣe awari nigbati abajade kan yẹ ki o han, ni akoko yẹn a yoo yọ asọye naa kuro:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text3"
msgstr "\"Virtualization\" DOM ti a ṣe imuse ni awọn ila 23, ko si iwulo fun awọn ile-ikawe alarinrin! Eyi ni iru koodu pragmatiki iyara ti o pari pẹlu nigbati o ni akoko to lopin, ati awọn iṣoro gidi ti o nilo lati yanju. A ti royin pe wiwa wa n ṣiṣẹ daradara bayi lori awọn ẹrọ ti o lọra!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text4"
msgstr "Akopọ nla miiran ni lati ṣe adaṣe ikole ibi ipamọ data naa. Nigbati a ṣe ifilọlẹ, a kan fa awọn orisun oriṣiriṣi papọ ni aibikita. Bayi a fẹ lati tọju wọn ni imudojuiwọn, nitorinaa a kọ ọpọlọpọ awọn iwe afọwọkọ lati ṣe igbasilẹ metadata tuntun lati awọn orita Library Genesis meji, ati ṣepọ wọn. Ero naa ni lati ma ṣe eyi nikan wulo fun ile-ikawe wa, ṣugbọn lati jẹ ki awọn nkan rọrun fun ẹnikẹni ti o fẹ lati ṣere pẹlu metadata ile-ikawe ojiji. Ero naa yoo jẹ iwe ajako Jupyter ti o ni gbogbo iru metadata ti o nifẹ si wa, nitorinaa a le ṣe iwadi diẹ sii bi figuring jade kini <a %(blog)s>ogorun ti ISBNs ti wa ni fipamọ lailai</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text5"
msgstr "Nikẹhin, a tun ṣe eto ẹbun wa. O le lo kaadi kirẹditi bayi lati fi owo taara sinu awọn apamọwọ crypto wa, laisi nilo lati mọ ohunkohun nipa awọn owo-iworo. A yoo tẹsiwaju lati ṣe atẹle bi eyi ṣe n ṣiṣẹ ni iṣe, ṣugbọn eyi jẹ ọrọ nla."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es"
msgstr "Yi pada si ElasticSearch"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text1"
msgstr "Ọkan ninu awọn <a %(annas_archive)s>tiketi</a> wa jẹ apo-gba ti awọn ọran pẹlu eto wiwa wa. A lo wiwa ọrọ kikun MySQL, niwọn igba ti a ni gbogbo data wa ni MySQL sibẹsibẹ. Ṣugbọn o ni awọn opin rẹ:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem1"
msgstr "Diẹ ninu awọn ibeere gba akoko pupọ, si aaye nibiti wọn yoo gba gbogbo awọn asopọ ṣiṣi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem2"
msgstr "Nipa aiyipada MySQL ni ipari ọrọ ti o kere ju, tabi itọka rẹ le tobi gaan. Awọn eniyan royin pe wọn ko le wa “Ben Hur”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem3"
msgstr "Wiwa jẹ iyara diẹ nigbati o kun ni iranti, eyiti o nilo wa lati gba ẹrọ ti o gbowolori diẹ sii lati ṣiṣẹ lori eyi, pẹlu diẹ ninu awọn aṣẹ lati ṣaju itọka ni ibẹrẹ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem4"
msgstr "A ko le ti ni anfani lati faagun rẹ ni irọrun lati kọ awọn ẹya tuntun, bii <a %(wikipedia_cjk_characters)s>tokenization ti o dara julọ fun awọn ede ti ko ni aaye funfun</a>, sisẹ/ifojusi, tito lẹšẹšẹ, awọn imọran \"ṣe o tumọ si\", autocomplete, ati bẹbẹ lọ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text2"
msgstr "Lẹhin ti o sọrọ si ọpọlọpọ awọn amoye, a yan ElasticSearch. Ko ti pe (awọn imọran “ṣe o tumọ si” aiyipada wọn ati awọn ẹya autocomplete ko dara), ṣugbọn ni apapọ o ti dara julọ ju MySQL lọ fun wiwa. A ko tun <a %(youtube)s>ni itara pupọ</a> lori lilo rẹ fun eyikeyi data pataki (botilẹjẹpe wọn ti ṣe ọpọlọpọ <a %(elastic_co)s>ilọsiwaju</a>), ṣugbọn ni apapọ a ni idunnu pupọ pẹlu iyipada naa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text3"
msgstr "Fun bayi, a ti ṣe imuse wiwa ti o yara pupọ, atilẹyin ede ti o dara julọ, tito lẹšẹšẹ pataki ti o dara julọ, awọn aṣayan tito lẹšẹšẹ oriṣiriṣi, ati sisẹ lori ede/iru iwe/iru faili. Ti o ba ni iyanilenu bi o ṣe n ṣiṣẹ, <a %(annas_archive_l140)s>ni</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1115)s>wo</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1635)s>kan</a>. O jẹ iraye si ni irọrun, botilẹjẹpe o le lo diẹ ninu awọn asọye diẹ sii…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers"
msgstr "300GB+ ti awọn ideri iwe ti a tu silẹ"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text1"
msgstr "Nikẹhin, a ni idunnu lati kede itusilẹ kekere kan. Ni ifowosowopo pẹlu awọn eniyan ti o ṣiṣẹ orita Libgen.rs, a n pin gbogbo awọn ideri iwe wọn nipasẹ awọn torrents ati IPFS. Eyi yoo pin ẹrù ti wiwo awọn ideri laarin awọn ẹrọ diẹ sii, ati pe yoo tọju wọn dara julọ. Ni ọpọlọpọ (ṣugbọn kii ṣe gbogbo) awọn ọran, awọn ideri iwe wa ninu awọn faili funrararẹ, nitorinaa eyi jẹ iru “data ti a fa jade”. Ṣugbọn nini rẹ ni IPFS tun wulo pupọ fun iṣẹ ojoojumọ ti mejeeji Ile-ikawe Anna ati awọn orita Library Genesis oriṣiriṣi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text2"
msgstr "Gẹgẹ bi igbagbogbo, o le rii itusilẹ yii ni Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: gbe si <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Ile-ikawe Anna</a>). A kii yoo so mọ si nibi, ṣugbọn o le rii ni irọrun."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text3"
msgstr "Ni ireti a le sinmi iyara wa diẹ, ni bayi ti a ni yiyan ti o dara si Z-Library. Iṣẹ yii kii ṣe pataki ni itọju. Ti o ba nifẹ si iranlọwọ pẹlu siseto, awọn iṣẹ olupin, tabi iṣẹ itọju, dajudaju kan si wa. Awọn iṣẹ pupọ tun wa <a %(annas_archive)s>lati ṣe</a>. O ṣeun fun ifẹ ati atilẹyin rẹ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.signature"
msgstr "- Anna ati ẹgbẹ (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.title"
msgstr "Ile-ikawe Anna ti ṣe afẹyinti ile-ikawe ojiji ti o tobi julọ ni agbaye (95TB) — o le ṣe iranlọwọ lati ṣe irugbin rẹ"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.tldr"
msgstr "Ile-ikawe ojiji awọn iwe apanilerin ti o tobi julọ ni agbaye ni aaye ikuna kan.. titi di oni."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.links"
msgstr "<a %(news_ycombinator)s>Jiroro lori Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text1"
msgstr "Iwe nla ti o tobi julo ti awọn iwe apanilerin ni o ṣee ṣe ti ẹya kan ti Library Genesis: Libgen.li. Oludari kan ṣoṣo ti o nṣiṣẹ aaye yẹn ṣakoso lati gba ikojọpọ apanilerin ti o ju awọn faili miliọnu 2 lọ, ti o ju 95TB lọ lapapọ. Sibẹsibẹ, ko dabi awọn ikojọpọ Library Genesis miiran, eyi ko si ni apapọ nipasẹ awọn torrents. O le wọle si awọn apanilerin wọnyi nikan lọkọọkan nipasẹ olupin ara ẹni rẹ ti o lọra — aaye kan ṣoṣo ti ikuna. Titi di oni!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text2"
msgstr "Ninu ifiweranṣẹ yii a yoo sọ fun ọ diẹ sii nipa ikojọpọ yii, ati nipa igbeowo wa lati ṣe atilẹyin diẹ sii fun iṣẹ yii."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fig1"
msgstr "<q>Dr. Barbara Gordon n gbiyanju lati padanu ara rẹ ninu aye lasan ti ile-ikawe…</q>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks"
msgstr "Awọn ẹya Libgen"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text1"
msgstr "Ni akọkọ, diẹ ninu awọn ipilẹ. O le mọ Library Genesis fun ikojọpọ iwe wọn ti o ni iyalẹnu. Awọn eniyan diẹ ni o mọ pe awọn oluyọọda Library Genesis ti ṣẹda awọn iṣẹ akanṣe miiran, gẹgẹbi ikojọpọ awọn iwe iroyin ati awọn iwe aṣẹ boṣewa, afẹyinti kikun ti Sci-Hub (ni ifowosowopo pẹlu oludasile Sci-Hub, Alexandra Elbakyan), ati nitootọ, ikojọpọ nla ti awọn apanilerin."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text2"
msgstr "Ni aaye kan awọn oniṣẹ oriṣiriṣi ti awọn digi Library Genesis lọ ni ọna wọn lọtọ, eyiti o fun ni aaye si ipo lọwọlọwọ ti nini nọmba awọn “ẹya” oriṣiriṣi, gbogbo wọn tun n gbe orukọ Library Genesis. Ẹya Libgen.li ni ikojọpọ apanilerin yii ni iyasọtọ, bakanna bi ikojọpọ awọn iwe iroyin nla (eyiti a tun n ṣiṣẹ lori)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration"
msgstr "Ifowosowopo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text1"
msgstr "Fun iwọn rẹ, ikojọpọ yii ti pẹ lori atokọ ifẹ wa, nitorinaa lẹhin aṣeyọri wa pẹlu afẹyinti Z-Library, a ṣeto oju wa lori ikojọpọ yii. Ni akọkọ a ti yọ taara, eyiti o jẹ ipenija nla, nitori olupin wọn ko wa ni ipo ti o dara julọ. A gba nipa 15TB ni ọna yii, ṣugbọn o lọra lọra."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text2"
msgstr "Ni orire, a ṣakoso lati kan si oniṣẹ ti ile-ikawe, ẹniti o gba lati fi gbogbo data ranṣẹ si wa taara, eyiti o yara pupọ. O tun gba ju idaji ọdun lọ lati gbe ati ṣe ilana gbogbo data naa, ati pe a fẹrẹ padanu gbogbo rẹ si ibajẹ disk, eyiti yoo ti tumọ si bẹrẹ gbogbo rẹ lati ibẹrẹ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text3"
msgstr "Iriri yii ti jẹ ki a gbagbọ pe o ṣe pataki lati gba data yii jade ni kiakia bi o ti ṣee, ki o le ṣe afihan jakejado. A kan jẹ ọkan tabi meji awọn iṣẹlẹ ti ko ni orire kuro lati padanu ikojọpọ yii lailai!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection"
msgstr "Ikojọpọ naa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text1"
msgstr "Gbigbe ni iyara tumọ si pe ikojọpọ naa jẹ diẹ ti ko ṣeto… Jẹ ki a wo. Fojuinu pe a ni eto faili (eyiti a n pin kaakiri awọn torrents):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text2"
msgstr "Ẹka akọkọ, <code>/repository</code>, jẹ apakan ti o ni eto diẹ sii ti eyi. Ẹka yii ni awọn “ẹgbẹrun dirs” ti a pe: awọn itọsọna kọọkan pẹlu ẹgbẹrun awọn faili, eyiti o wa ni nọmba ni ilọsiwaju ninu ibi ipamọ data. Ẹka <code>0</code> ni awọn faili pẹlu comic_id 0–999, ati bẹbẹ lọ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text3"
msgstr "Eyi jẹ eto kanna ti Library Genesis ti nlo fun awọn ikojọpọ itan ati ti kii ṣe itan. Ero naa ni pe gbogbo “ẹgbẹrun dir” ni a yipada laifọwọyi si torrent ni kete ti o kun."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text4"
msgstr "Sibẹsibẹ, oniṣẹ Libgen.li ko ṣe awọn torrents fun ikojọpọ yii, ati nitorinaa awọn ẹgbẹrun dirs ṣee ṣe di alailagbara, ati fun ọna si “awọn dirs ti ko ṣeto”. Awọn wọnyi ni <code>/comics0</code> nipasẹ <code>/comics4</code>. Wọn gbogbo ni awọn eto itọsọna alailẹgbẹ, ti o ṣee ṣe lati ni oye fun gbigba awọn faili, ṣugbọn ko ni oye pupọ si wa bayi. Ni orire, metadata tun tọka taara si gbogbo awọn faili wọnyi, nitorinaa eto ibi ipamọ wọn lori disk ko ṣe pataki gaan!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text5"
msgstr "Metadata wa ni irisi ibi ipamọ data MySQL. Eyi le ṣe igbasilẹ taara lati oju opo wẹẹbu Libgen.li, ṣugbọn a yoo tun ṣe wa ni torrent, lẹgbẹẹ tabili tiwa pẹlu gbogbo awọn MD5 hashes."

